  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>6-seater LSV & 6 Bikes INCLUDED!<br><br>Just a 5-MINUTE walk to the beach and other local favorites! PRIME Seagrove / Eastern Lake location!<br><br>Featuring 7 bedrooms, including 6 KINGS and a bunk room with Queen & Twin bunks!<br><br>Fully loaded with a private pool, hot tub, outdoor shower, BBQ grill, multiple living rooms, Sonos speakers, ping pong table, games, wet bar, two full-sized refrigerators, and MORE!<br><br>Sleeps up to 20!<br><br>The space<br><br>Welcome to 'Tides & Tanlines!'<br><br>Located just a short walk away from the beach, great restaurants and shops, like Greenway Station, Old Florida Fish House, Beachy Bean Coffee Co., Steamboat Grill, and more! Plus, you're only a quick LSV ride away from The Big Chill and Seaside!<br><br>As you step inside, the first floor opens up into a bright and airy living room where modern design meets beachy comfort. A large sectional and cozy armchairs invite you to relax in front of the TV, enhanced by Sonos speakers for a quality entertainment experience. The open-concept floor plan flows seamlessly into the chef's kitchen, complete with sleek marble countertops, two full-sized refrigerators, and a large island with barstools. Just past the kitchen is the dining room with TWO large dining tables! Also on the first floor is a half bathroom, as well as the a bedroom with a King bed and an en-suite bathroom with a glass shower - great for parents/grandparents!<br><br>Step outside into your own private backyard oasis, complete with a HUGE refreshing private pool, hot tub, privacy fence, BBQ grill, outdoor shower, and a covered back porch with cozy seating and an outdoor dining table.<br><br>Heading upstairs to the second floor, you'll find 3 luxurious bedrooms along with the laundry room. The first is the master suite, featuring a King bed, private balcony with a balcony swing, walk-in closet, and an en-suite bathroom with double vanities, glass shower, and a separate soaking tub. The other two bedrooms on this floor both have King beds, access to a shared balcony, and en-suite bathrooms with glass showers.<br><br>On the third floor, a second living room offers the perfect hangout space for kids with a ping pong table, wet bar, and balcony overlooking the backyard. The third floor also includes 3 more guest bedrooms, the first two both with King beds, access to a shared balcony, and an en-suite bathroom with a glass shower. The 7th bedroom is a bunk room featuring one set of Queen-over-Queen bunks, one set of Twin-over-Twin bunks (easily sleeping 6), and a dedicated hallway bathroom with a glass shower.<br><br>There is parking available for about 6-7 cars in the driveway!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 20 Guests):<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>-Living Room<br>-Dining Room<br>-Kitchen<br>-Half Bathroom<br>-Bedroom 1: King bed, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>-Laundry Room<br>-Bedroom 2 (Master): King bed, balcony access, walk-in closet, en-suite bathroom with dual vanities, glass shower, and separate soaking tub<br>-Bedroom 3: King bed, balcony access, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br>-Bedroom 4: King bed, balcony access, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>-Living Room 2 with Ping Pong table and wet bar<br>-Bedroom 5: King bed, balcony access, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br>-Bedroom 6: King bed, balcony access, en-suite bathroom with glass shower<br>-Bedroom 7: Bunk Room with one Queen-over-Queen bunk bed and one Twin-over-Twin bunk bed, dedicated hallway bathroom with glass shower<br><br>There is also a pack n' play and air mattress at the home for guests' use!<br><br>Guest access<br><br>Guests will have complimentary access to a 6-seater LSV and 6 bikes.<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Please note we provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay.<br>-Check in is 4:00 PM & check out is 10:00 AM. Late check out / early check in will be subject to another day's rental fees.<br>-Smoking is prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-LSV is not to be driven past the town of Alys Beach to the east or the town of Seaside to the west. Resolving any issue from the LSV battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters. <br>-Pool and hot tub/spa heating must be for the full duration of your stay and must be requested 48 hours prior to check-in and paid before the heater will be turned on. Pool heating cost is $50/night of your reservation and is available October 1st - April 30th. After April 30, guests can still heat the spa or hot tub for the same daily rate.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters.<br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV, bikes, pool, spa, or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Private Pool, Spa, LSV, & Bikes! Steps to Beach! Sleeps 20!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
