            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your lovely review! We’re thrilled to hear the home was comfortable and well equipped for your stay!\n\nWe will definitely add that \"juice squeezer\" on our inventory list! 🍹\n\nIt was truly a pleasure hosting you, and we would be delighted to welcome you back anytime for another beach getaway.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house was lovely and very accommodating. The kitchen was well equipped with everything needed to prepare a meal or beverages with the exception of maybe a “ juice squeezer”…We’re margarita girls! The location was perfect, and centrally located for shopping and eating in nearby beach communities such as Seaside and Grayton. We would definitely consider another stay!",
